   {
      // A human readable identifier for the type name of the usage specification. This shall be a text string in the following format as defined in the LDM Methodology and Modelling Standard:
      // 
      // The uppercase labels that prefix each descriptor value are literal strings. Names in <angleBrackets> represent placeholders for actual values.
